ing for  decades and one of the things that we  want to say to folks is it is doable  it is not easy it's not everybody can't  do it but it is doable and those who can  do it need to do it in places if you  care about this country and you believe  in America Esther says in theory that's  what this country stands for we have to  turn that theory into fact and this is  how I believe you can do it at scale  well you can see why this man is a hero  of mine right and as a hero should be  here of everybody and just recognized so  you know like we're waiting for Superman  you are our Superman man so thank you  very much  [Applause]
 

